    "title": "Owner of Maze Books in Rockford gets holiday bonus from author James Patterson - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kevin Haas ,\n4 hours ago ROCKFORD — The owner of an independent bookstore in downtown was among 600 booksellers gifted a $500 holiday bonus from best-selling author James Patterson. Dave Pedersen of Maze Books, 406 E. State St., is one of 34 independent booksellers from Illinois on this year’s list of recipients. Patterson, a prolific author who has sold hundreds of millions of novels, has made a tradition of sending checks to booksellers who have been nominated by customers or their peers. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
